                <mxCell id="v173" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules the database cannot express (API enforces, inside one transaction)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Max 9999 live notes per workspace (trashed ones do not count). Max 999 workspaces per user (owned + shared).&lt;br&gt;Max 1000 per event = 999 subscribers + organizer. API locks the event row (FOR UPDATE), counts active rows, inserts.&lt;br&gt;Username changes once per 7 days. 10 failed logins lock the account 24 h. ONE active session per user: a new sign-in revokes the old one (unique index); every request checks the session row.&lt;br&gt;Invite redeem is one atomic UPDATE (see schema.sql): unused, not revoked, not expired, event not ended or trashed, AND the signed-in verified email = ei_invitee_email. Invite quota: 20/day per organizer, 50 per event.&lt;br&gt;Trash: deleted_at + purge_after (retention_policy, 15 d default per object type). Purge job deletes S3 files first, then rows. S3 versioning off on the notes bucket.&lt;br&gt;Note lock (per note): acquire_note_lock() takes or renews it (2 min without heartbeat frees it); take_over_note_lock() lets the workspace owner replace it; a revoked session frees its locks. Gmail pool: pick_mail_account() chooses an enabled account under its daily limit.&lt;br&gt;Organizer is an implicit subscriber and has no row in event_subscriptions.&lt;br&gt;Prisma: schema.sql PART 1 (tables) is modelled by schema.prisma; PART 2 (partial unique indexes, triggers, functions) is raw SQL kept in the migration." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="330" width="330" x="1290" y="676" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v174" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Changed from the first draft&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Removed Date(Struct) and Time(Struct): timestamptz + IANA timezone. Removed us_passwordSeed (salt lives inside the argon2id hash).&lt;br&gt;Removed array columns: now join tables. IDs are UUIDs.&lt;br&gt;Revision 3: email is plaintext; SMS cut; trash columns; invites carry the invitee email; fixed tag list; accessibility toggles; translations bundled with the frontend.&lt;br&gt;Revision 4: one active session per user; retention_policy + *_purge_after; mail_accounts pool; invitee email required; n_format removed (.md only); events up to 30 days; reminders X and start only.&lt;br&gt;Revision 5: Prisma-compatible layout; lock is per NOTE (note_locks), owner can take over; phone kept at sign-up; tg_name is a plain unique column; tags and mail ids are integers." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="230" width="330" x="1290" y="1036" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v175" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key, FK foreign key, UQ unique&lt;br&gt;*enc = encrypted by the app before insert&lt;br&gt;crow&#39;s foot = many side is the table that holds the FK" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="80" width="330" x="1290" y="1296" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n9508" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=28;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#647687;strokeColor=#314354;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="mail_accounts (Gmail pool, v1)" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="196" width="240" x="1660" y="258" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
